<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 525 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 525 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 525 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>It allotted all the help in repos to March 24 &amp; 25. The Bank's repo rate is 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
